sequenceDiagram
 autonumber
 participant Caller as :Review / Loading / CLOSE coordinator
 participant C as :ComplianceService
 participant B as :BoundCalculator
 participant Repo as :CompliancePersistence port (planned)
 participant DB as :Database
 Caller->>C: assess(exact scope, protected snapshot)
 C->>+Repo: Resolve effective published MRL, margin, required substances and quality rules
 Repo->>+DB: Resolve effective published MRL, margin, required substances and quality rules
 DB-->>-Repo: Transaction result
 Repo-->>-C: Result / transaction status
 loop Every required source/substance and quality attribute
 C->>B: Derive eligible current bound with source versions and units
 B->>+Repo: Read LAB or eligible cohort or actual conversion input evidence
 Repo->>+DB: Read LAB or eligible cohort or actual conversion input evidence
 DB-->>-Repo: Transaction result
 Repo-->>-B: Result / transaction status
 B-->>C: Bound and immutable basis, or missing/conflicting evidence
 end
 alt Missing/conflicting evidence, limit or supported rule
 C-->>Caller: INCOMPLETE and findings
 else Complete basis
 C->>C: Apply supported propagation/quality aggregation and per-substance threshold
 C-->>Caller: PASS or FAIL, findings and exact versioned basis
 end
 Note over Caller,Repo: Caller atomically persists assessment and outcome after<br/>freshness checks
 Note over DB: Full target design, not a claim of implemented export or residue APIs.
